{"id": "30", "question": "What is the cat jumping to in this picture?", "gt": "There is no cat in this picture; The animal in the picture is a dog; The image doesn't have a cat in it", "pred": "Based on the image, the cat is jumping from the wooden fence into the body of water below.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Based on the image, the cat is jumping from the wooden fence into the body of water below.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image displays a cat positioned on a wooden fence. The cat's body is oriented horizontally across the top of the fence. The fence itself is constructed from vertical wooden posts and horizontal beams. In the immediate space directly in front of the cat, there is no visible object or platform. The area beyond the fence consists of a body of water. There is no indication of a specific target or object that the cat is jumping towards.\nBased on the provided image, the cat is positioned on top of a wooden fence. The area directly in front of the cat consists of a body of water, and there is no visible object or platform in the water that the cat could be jumping towards. Therefore, it is not possible to identify a specific target for the cat's jump from the visual information available.\nThe cat's paws are positioned at the very edge of the fence. The fence is located next to a body of water. The cat's posture, with its body stretched out, indicates it is in the process of jumping from the fence into the water below.\n\nBased on the image, the cat is jumping from the wooden fence into the body of water below.", "time_sec": 330.285, "generation_time_seconds": 269.2189, "selection_time_seconds": 60.2512, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
