bstract, pixelated, and fragmented composition that does not clearly depict a cat or any mice.", "time_sec": 303.509, "generation_time_seconds": 243.1163, "selection_time_seconds": 59.5381, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
