orms under a grey, cloudy sky. There are no discernible human forms, limbs, heads, or any other features that would indicate the presence of a person or figure. The entire composition is non-representational and lacks any identifiable characters or objects.\n\nBased on the visual evidence, the image does not contain an astronaut or any person wearing clothing. The image is an abstract, digital artwork composed of glitch-like patterns, fractal textures, and fragmented shapes, with no discernible human figures.", "time_sec": 385.027, "generation_time_seconds": 312.7935, "selection_time_seconds": 70.8162, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
