ollage composed entirely of rectangular sections, each depicting a cloudy or overcast sky.", "time_sec": 316.393, "generation_time_seconds": 245.2206, "selection_time_seconds": 69.7602, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
